1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:03,590
Welcome everyone to Oikos University!

2
00:00:03,590 --> 00:00:08,114
I am Professor Peter Kim, Director of the Smart Insight Lab.

3
00:00:08,114 --> 00:00:18,220
Today marks the official opening of our master curriculum: "The Architect of Intelligence: Mastering Agentic IT and Strategic Wisdom."

4
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:25,087
And a very warm welcome to all our undergraduate and graduate students joining us from across the globe!

5
00:00:25,087 --> 00:00:29,001
I'm Sarah Jenkins, your Teaching Assistant and AI Research Fellow.

6
00:00:29,001 --> 00:00:39,440
Professor Kim and I have designed this comprehensive 60-minute master lecture to fundamentally transform how you understand, design, and deploy artificial intelligence systems.

7
00:00:40,140 --> 00:00:53,968
Look at our opening title displayed on the screen: "From Waiting Chatbots to Sleep-Free Personal Avatars." Over the past three years, the entire software industry has been trapped in a reactive paradigm.

8
00:00:53,968 --> 00:01:05,480
People interact with AI like an electronic textbook sitting on a desk—you type a question, stare at a blinking cursor, wait for the response, and manually copy the text.

9
00:01:06,180 --> 00:01:10,100
But in 2026, we are entering the true agentic revolution.

10
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:13,951
AI is no longer just a chatbot waiting in a browser tab.

11
00:01:13,951 --> 00:01:28,740
It has evolved into a persistent, autonomous personal avatar—a digital co-worker that operates in cloud memory 24 hours a day, 7 days a week, continuously executing complex multi-step workflows even while you sleep!

12
00:01:29,440 --> 00:01:34,642
Our guiding institutional motto is "Soli Deo Gloria"—Glory to God alone.

13
00:01:34,642 --> 00:01:50,610
We teach this advanced technology not merely to produce more lines of code, but to redeem finite human time, eliminate soul-crushing mechanical drudgery, and elevate human dignity, strategic wisdom, and community service.

14
00:01:51,310 --> 00:02:06,502
To make this 60-minute lecture easy to study and review for your student pair video assignments, we have structured our class into three distinct 20-minute modules: Foundations in Part 1, Engineering Pipelines in Part 2, and Security Governance in Part 3.

15
00:02:06,502 --> 00:02:09,720
Let us embark on this transformative journey together!

